# Security

- No secrets in source or client bundle
- `SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY` server-only — never `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`
- Invite tokens unguessable; validate sessions server-side
- Do not log passwords, tokens, or PII
- See `docs/SECURITY.md`
